 * getAllColumns does NOT lowercase → keys like "MY_SCHEMA.my_table"
 * Schema differ can't correlate them → reports all FKs as missing.
 *
 * Setup (run as SYSDBA in Oracle):
 *   ALTER SESSION SET CONTAINER = FREEPDB1;
 *   CREATE USER MY_SCHEMA IDENTIFIED BY test QUOTA UNLIMITED ON USERS;
 *   GRANT CONNECT, RESOURCE, CREATE TABLE TO MY_SCHEMA;
 *
 * Then connect as MY_SCHEMA and create tables with quoted (lowercase) names:
 *   CREATE TABLE "parents" ("id" NUMBER PRIMARY KEY);
 *   CREATE TABLE "children" ("id" NUMBER PRIMARY KEY, "parent_id" NUMBER NOT NULL);
 *   ALTER TABLE "children" ADD CONSTRAINT "children_parent_id_foreign"
 *     FOREIGN KEY ("parent_id") REFERENCES "parents" ("id");
 *
 * Run: npx tsx mikro-orm-oracle-fk-bug-poc.ts
 *
 * Tested on: @mikro-orm/oracledb 7.1.5 (bug also present on current master)
